<head>
<no>1</no><heading guid="_beedfeda-7785-4a93-b7e3-9523e9d0b26a"
id="sec.1-he"><b>Name of Act</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act may be cited as the <legref
refid="act-1975-049" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Parliamentary Papers (Supplementary Provisions) Act
1975</i></name></legref>.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_89700f90-a6ff-45ac-9ed9-f69c68bcb833"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>2</no><heading guid="_1600ff67-fe76-436b-b8fb-8357092258ce"
id="sec.2-he"><b>Commencement</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act shall be deemed to have commenced on 1
July 1974.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_2ac77947-01c9-4bf7-9f18-91c09edb72cd"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>3</no><heading guid="_c0d5b437-b4fa-429d-9564-bdf4c071149a"
id="sec.3-he"><b>Definitions</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b663b6b5-815f-44ff-8443-69733f5b0d1a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this Act, except in so far as the context or
subject-matter otherwise indicates or requires&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_5edce83f-c159-4452-9eb7-dc986190f8ae"
id="sec.3-def.Committee"><b><i>Committee</i></b></defterm> means a committee
of both Houses or either House.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b452e1e9-464b-4434-9c33-617b46ae477a"
id="sec.3-def.House"><b><i>House</i></b></defterm> means House of
Parliament.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_b1678c7b-d49a-47aa-8181-9cd70d5bc15e"
id="sec.3-def.jointsitting"><b><i>joint sitting</i></b></defterm>
means&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_88b6d948-3a58-4766-a25e-db8622290249" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">a joint sitting of the Members of the Legislative
Council and the Members of the Legislative Assembly convened under section 5B
(1) or 22D (1) of the <legref refid="act-1902-032" jurisd="NSW" type="act"
check="unknown"><name emphasis="yes"><i>Constitution Act
1902</i></name></legref>, or</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_8c8cd256-2490-4f55-8aaf-844326f08ce3" id="sec.3-ssec.1-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Houses sitting and voting together under
section 15 of the Commonwealth of Australia Constitution
Act.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.3-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f60913aa-5652-4b2f-aa01-ea7f7cef7fd8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.3-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Notes included in this Act do not form part of
this Act.</txt></block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 3:</b> Am 1978 No 82,
sec 2; 2005 No 77, Sch 6.14 [1].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_556ae8e9-9da0-425c-8179-9cc2ade0a659"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>4</no><heading guid="_f1b0f0a1-57e4-490c-b3e9-67980737d684"
id="sec.4-he"><b>Publication of Parliamentary papers</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_0a03b874-64fc-4018-b026-f08b64c58f94"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Either House or a joint sitting may authorise the
publication of a document laid before it.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.4-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_53be814d-6d5b-4f03-a310-005e3df91258"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.4-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A Committee may authorise the publication of a
document received by it or evidence given before it.</txt></block></tier>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.5">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_85591636-07a2-4f98-9a04-7b8161749dd0"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>5</no><heading guid="_ef5870fc-43d7-4e6c-9ae6-c5e97d13d293"
id="sec.5-he"><b>Authority to publish</b></heading></head>

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_585e9049-1cd4-4f0f-bb52-6683c88bd413"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">When either House, a joint sitting or a Committee
orders a document or evidence to be published, a relevant person may publish
the document or evidence unless the contrary intention appears in the
order.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_30dfaa96-069e-4dea-8731-4a9edb1c27a5"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A relevant person is authorised to publish the
reports of the debates and proceedings in each House and of a joint
sitting.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.5-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_d58dd383-2a7f-4ba8-88cd-e057bdadfcca"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.5-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_7b3ec23c-1527-4952-835f-cca8d6004a4f"
id="sec.5-def.publish"><b><i>publish</i></b></defterm> includes
print.</txt></block>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_d640194f-7a05-4769-a767-3028c9774140"
id="sec.5-def.relevantperson"><b><i>relevant person</i></b></defterm> means
the following&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_eab3b920-8cdd-4c7b-8dcd-773eddd3d438" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Clerk of the Parliaments and Clerk of the
Legislative Council,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_7939bf4d-4951-4e28-9e85-dc6350132029" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Deputy Clerk of the Legislative
Council,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_086be494-62cb-4f0e-b9f8-b5d59d17035f" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Clerk of the Legislative
Assembly,</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_f5e9fff5-7905-4299-8113-6c46a499123a" id="sec.5-ssec.3-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the Deputy Clerk of the Legislative
Assembly.</txt></block></li></list>
</block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 5:</b> Am 2024 No 82,
Sch 3.7[1]&#8211;[4].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.6">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_f3900f40-3718-459b-b449-8ce941217cd7"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.6"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>6</no><heading guid="_dae32421-b0a5-429d-98d3-8c470d932bc4"
id="sec.6-he"><b>Defence to proceedings brought in respect of publication of
Parliamentary papers</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Subject to section 7, it is a defence to any
action or proceeding, civil or criminal, brought in respect of the publication
of any document or any copy thereof or any evidence if it is proved that the
publication of the document, the document from which the copy was made or the
evidence, as the case may be, was authorised under section 4 or by section
5.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.7">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_cf009c6f-3a68-4a7a-946b-49bb3b1c12d8"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.7"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>7</no><heading guid="_e35ecc4a-b0f0-4e8d-b51c-15dd1ffc2d90"
id="sec.7-he"><b>Proceedings for defamation</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This Act does not operate so as to provide or
affect a defence to an action or proceeding for defamation.</txt></block>
<note type="legtext" guid="_132bb531-a545-45bb-85cb-374b9c8ae884"
id="sec.7-note"><heading guid="_237f31f6-c349-4f40-b583-743d57dfa02a"
id="sec.7-note-he"><b>Note&#8212;</b></heading>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 27 (2) (a) of the <legref
refid="act-2005-077" jurisd="NSW" type="act" check="unknown"><name
emphasis="yes"><i>Defamation Act 2005</i></name></legref> provides that the
publication of defamatory matter in the course of proceedings of a
parliamentary body attracts the defence of absolute privilege in defamation
proceedings, including (but not limited to)&#8212;</txt>
<list number.type="default" unnumbered.indent="0">
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_68d79b54-6a74-4a73-a5c6-2d01c53ed230" id="sec.7-note-para1.a">
<no>(a)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the publication of a document by order, or under
the authority, of the body, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_eb5195bd-9614-4b41-8083-77eeba693703" id="sec.7-note-para1.b">
<no>(b)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the publication of the debates and proceedings of
the body by or under the authority of the body or any law,
and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_212b3274-a3ae-41ea-853a-e36b41246061" id="sec.7-note-para1.c">
<no>(c)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the publication of matter while giving evidence
before the body, and</txt></block></li>
<li provision.type="other" affected.by.uncommenced="0"
guid="_dd64716a-d7c5-4bb4-af2c-ea22d2fd1114" id="sec.7-note-para1.d">
<no>(d)</no>
<block><txt break.before="1">the publication of matter while presenting or
submitting a document to the body.</txt></block></li></list>
</block>
<block><txt break.before="1">Section 4 of that Act defines a <defterm
type="definition" guid="_03338f4b-556b-46f1-ba23-dd2a1f83c0f6"
id="sec.7-def.parliamentarybody"><b><i>parliamentary body</i></b></defterm> to
include a parliament or legislature, a house of a parliament or legislature
and committees of any such parliament, legislature or
house.</txt></block></note>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 7, note:</b> Ins 2005
No 77, Sch 6.14 [2].</txt></content>
</level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.8">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3c3b5218-8731-4581-8d3e-1a6e3746af8d"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.8"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>8</no><heading guid="_fb334783-4a7a-4853-aafd-27594a0009d5"
id="sec.8-he"><b>Parliamentary privileges not affected</b></heading></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">Nothing in this Act derogates from a power or
privilege of either House, the Members of either House, or a
Committee.</txt></block></level>


<level type="clause" id="sec.9">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="spent.amends" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_ce63a54b-4221-4ff6-8e7f-d8ef98b9ce07"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>9</no><heading guid="_e4274b7a-0c3d-42d0-a7ed-013224760f66"
id="sec.9-he"><b>NSW Parliament website</b></heading></head>

<pre type="auto-inserted">

<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.1">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_b54eba9a-50f0-4817-91e7-07a1c0fac5d3"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.1"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(1)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">An Act that authorises the Clerk of a House of
Parliament to print a document authorises the Clerk to publish the document on
the NSW Parliament website.</txt></block></tier>
</pre>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.2">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_4ee35f19-b1bb-4bbd-b495-0c7bc1a79a0a"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.2"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(2)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">A document published by the Clerk of a House of
Parliament on the NSW Parliament website is taken to be printed by, or by the
authority of, the Clerk.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.3">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_25966b53-01ac-4778-9450-dbfb36283a92"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.3"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(3)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">This section extends to anything done before the
commencement of this section.</txt></block></tier>


<tier type="subclause" id="sec.9-ssec.4">
<parentattributes>
<attrib name="affected.by.uncommenced" value="0"></attrib>
<attrib name="provision.type" value="other"></attrib>
<attrib name="guid" value="_3210dac6-caa4-4125-93e6-97e86ad3a681"></attrib>
<attrib name="id" value="sec.9-ssec.4"></attrib></parentattributes>

<head>
<no>(4)</no></head>
<block><txt break.before="1">In this section&#8212;</txt>
<deflist>
<block><txt break.before="1"><defterm type="definition"
guid="_3e16bcb2-16ba-4d0d-9e5b-4cb6de246772"
id="sec.9-def.NSWParliamentwebsite"><b><i>NSW Parliament
website</i></b></defterm> means the website with the URL of
www.parliament.nsw.gov.au, or another website used by the Parliament of New
South Wales.</txt></block></deflist>
</block></tier>


<content type="historynote"><txt break.before="1"><b>s 9:</b> Ins 2024 No 82,
Sch 3.7[5].</txt></content>
</level>
</content>


<content type="editorial">

<level type="historicalnotes">
<head><heading guid="_cb97a8b7-60ec-49fc-93e7-fb08efa71ee3"
id="ed-he"><b>Historical notes</b></heading></head>

<level type="tableleg">
